    "maturity": "executable-core",
    "notes": [
      "The bible's 'cancel one understood machine, ritual or phase activation'. The engine's one declared action is a hostile's turn, so the denial is a one-round Stunned: the hostile's turn opens, the stun is spent, the turn ends and it never acts.",
      "Once per site, and the site is the cell's dungeon where it has one -- the whole tomb is one site, so walking into the next room does not refresh the charge. ExpeditionState.site_denial_charges keeps the count and it survives a save."
    ]
